BA_ "Description" SG_ 1099 WPC_SWVerMajor1 "Indicate the WPC software version as follows:
- The software version is displayed in three digits.
- The Major and Minor digits are separated by '.'
- Signal values are transmitted to ASCII codes.

『 Example
WPC_SWVerMajor1 : 0x41 (HEX) -> ASCII CODE : 'A' 
WPC_SWVerMinor1 : 0x30 (HEX) -> ASCII CODE : '0'
WPC_SWVerMinor2 : 0x33 (HEX) -> ASCII CODE : '3'
=> WPC S/W Ver is displayed 'A.03'";
